<chapter xml:id="ch-review-and-suggestions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Editorial Review: Suggestions and Inconsistencies</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter is an editorial appendix rather than instructional material. It
      tracks the remaining review findings for the manual. It is intended as a working
      checklist for the author and can be removed from the final published version once
      the remaining items have been resolved.
    </p>
  </introduction>

  <!-- ============================================================= -->
